  - en: A new cycle begins. Your unlocked power stays with you.
    vi: "Chu k\u1EF3 m\u1EDBi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. S\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh \u0111\xE3 m\u1EDF v\u1EABn \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n."
