    vi: "Th\u1EDDi gian s\u0103n \u0111u\u1ED5i t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng khi b\u1EA1n h\u1ECDc."
  - en: Each first mastery grants one breakthrough. Retakes improve knowledge without farming power.
    vi: "M\u1ED7i b\xE0i v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u cho m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED9t ph\xE1. Thi l\u1EA1i gi\xFAp c\u1EE7ng c\u1ED1 ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c, kh\xF4ng c\u1EA5p th\xEAm s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh."
